flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7714611Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7714938Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7715339Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7715468Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7715607Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7716475Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7716729Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7716910Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7717273Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7717416Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7717724Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7718049Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7718355Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7718564Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7718673Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7718835Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7718992Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7719114Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7719331Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7719411Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7719481Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7719588Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7719744Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
