flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7723894Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7724145Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7724283Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7724524Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7724925Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
