flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7725545Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-13T09:46:39.7725748Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
